==English==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|en|resistive|ity}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|electricity}} The [[electrical resistance|resistance]] offered at a particular temperature by an electrical [[conductor]] of any given material in a [[cube]] of unit length, expressed in [[ohm-metre]]s (Ωm) in the [[metric system]] of measurement.
# {{lb|en|thermodynamics}} The {{l|en|reciprocal}} of {{l|en|thermal conductivity}}, having SI unit: m K W<sup>-1</sup>

